Package: clipup
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: clipboard manager for V\OS
 ClipUp watches the clipboard and keeps a history of clippings in a
 floating menu, with optional input-server filter add-ons (including a
 Ctrl-V watcher).
